    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Martin, d\u00e9sabus\u00e9 pour avoir trop aim\u00e9 et trop v\u00e9cu, retourne chez son p\u00e8re, un horticulteur romantique en fin de course. Il y retrouve Gabriel, son jeune fr\u00e8re de 16 ans, exalt\u00e9 et id\u00e9aliste, qu\u2019il va tenter de d\u00e9go\u00fbter de l\u2019amour, sans rel\u00e2che. Mais c\u2019est sans compter sur Mathilde, jeune femme flamboyante et joueuse, qui va bousculer tous leurs rep\u00e8res...",
        "english": "Martin, disillusioned by having loved and lived too much, returns to see his father, a romantic horticulturist reaching the end of his life. Once back home, he encounters Gabriel, his brother who is sixteen years his junior and a total, excitable idealist. Martin then tries to constantly put his younger sibling off love. But he hasn't taken into account Mathilde, a young, flamboyant and playful woman, who make them both lose all their bearings."
